01:29.950 --> 01:32.740
The game resumes, and Argentina has the ball.

01:31.180 --> 01:34.460
International Stadium of Paris

01:40.420 --> 01:42.230
Out of the blue, it's Diaz,

01:42.230 --> 01:44.260
storming into Japan's territory!

01:44.610 --> 01:46.060
Hyuga!

01:46.060 --> 01:47.950
He got past him!

01:47.950 --> 01:49.490
Over here, Diaz!

01:49.490 --> 01:50.260
Diaz!

01:50.690 --> 01:53.390
I won't let Japan make fools out of us!

01:53.390 --> 01:55.520
Diaz runs into Ohzora!

01:55.520 --> 01:57.040
This is the anticipated duel!

01:59.390 --> 02:01.410
He got past Ohzora, too!

02:01.410 --> 02:02.380
However,

02:02.380 --> 02:05.940
Misaki, and also Ohzora, catch up to Diaz!

02:13.300 --> 02:18.460
<b>Genius Juan Diaz</b>

02:13.300 --> 02:18.460
<b>Genius Juan Diaz</b>

02:21.780 --> 02:26.340
Argentina, Buenos Aires

02:36.180 --> 02:37.360
Oops!

02:38.500 --> 02:39.780
Nice pass!

02:42.140 --> 02:43.570
Hey, over here!

02:43.570 --> 02:44.500
Back to you!

02:45.520 --> 02:47.820
I'm taking this apple, mister!

02:47.820 --> 02:49.720
H-Hey, you've gotta pay!

02:49.720 --> 02:51.450
G-Give it back!

02:51.450 --> 02:54.980
Geez, they're such dirty brats.

02:54.980 --> 02:56.720
Over here, Pascual!

02:56.720 --> 02:57.410
Here you go!

02:57.410 --> 02:57.980
Got it!

02:57.980 --> 03:01.040
What can one do with such brats?

03:01.040 --> 03:04.320
Those kids are good at lifting.

03:04.320 --> 03:04.980
Oh?

03:04.980 --> 03:06.440
Yeah.

03:06.440 --> 03:09.750
They're kids from this village: Diaz and Pascual.

03:09.750 --> 03:13.740
They're dirty brats, but they're really good at soccer.

03:14.250 --> 03:17.740
Hopefully, they'll turn into great players in the future.

03:20.170 --> 03:21.970
When it comes to soccer,

03:21.970 --> 03:25.110
there's nobody better than these two around here.

03:28.440 --> 03:29.600
Diaz,

03:29.600 --> 03:30.670
Pascual.

03:33.830 --> 03:35.500
Catch this, Diaz!

03:51.450 --> 03:52.660
Goal!

03:52.660 --> 03:55.180
Japan's now down a goal!

03:55.180 --> 03:58.060
It was scored by Diaz, the Argentine prodigy,

03:58.060 --> 03:59.180
and the assist was from Pascual!

03:59.180 --> 04:01.920
Those two make a fearsome duo!

04:04.860 --> 04:07.180
If Japan wants to reach the final in this tournament,

04:07.180 --> 04:10.700
they'll need to beat Argentina, who's currently leading.

04:11.510 --> 04:13.270
A draw is not an option for Japan.

04:13.270 --> 04:16.020
This is not a good start for the Japanese team.

04:16.700 --> 04:20.690
Diaz and Pascual's combination play is splendid, isn't it?

04:20.690 --> 04:23.490
We're not here to praise the opponents, are we?

04:23.490 --> 04:24.920
Geez!

04:24.920 --> 04:29.610
Let's hope that somehow the Japanese team will do a fast counter and equalize the score.

04:39.490 --> 04:40.920
Did you understand, Diaz?

04:40.920 --> 04:44.220
Be extra careful when it comes to Japan's number 10, Ohzora Tsubasa.

04:44.220 --> 04:45.620
Eh?

04:45.620 --> 04:47.700
Tsubasa Ohzora?

04:47.700 --> 04:52.220
Coach, nobody in this tournament can match my speed and technique.

04:52.220 --> 04:53.460
Count on me!

04:53.460 --> 04:57.240
Tsubasa has a really strong shot called the "Drive Shot."

04:57.240 --> 05:01.980
It was my best friend, Roberto Hongo, who taught him that shot.

05:01.980 --> 05:03.470
Roberto?

05:03.470 --> 05:06.960
Are you talking about the retired forward, the star from Brazil, Roberto Hongo?

05:06.960 --> 05:10.860
He said Tsubasa's a soccer prodigy.

05:10.860 --> 05:12.500
You should keep your guard up.

05:13.110 --> 05:14.420
A prodigy?

05:15.350 --> 05:17.780
I'm the only soccer prodigy.

05:17.780 --> 05:20.880
I'll prove that during this game.

05:32.330 --> 05:35.200
You should avoid passes that are easy to intercept.

05:35.200 --> 05:37.700
This is how you're supposed to pass!

05:38.860 --> 05:41.660
Wow! The pass from Diaz reached Pascual.

05:41.660 --> 05:43.770
Come forward, Pascual!

05:43.770 --> 05:45.990
Diaz runs forward at an unbelievable speed!

05:46.700 --> 05:48.940
Let's play like we always do.

05:49.620 --> 05:51.460
Yeah, you can count on me.

05:52.250 --> 05:55.060
Now he breaks away from Pascual...

05:54.650 --> 05:55.060
Here!

05:55.060 --> 05:56.190
And shoots it from in front of the goal!

06:00.570 --> 06:02.140
Goal!

06:02.680 --> 06:04.680
Argentina is fast to get their second goal!

06:04.680 --> 06:07.770
The keeper, Wakashimazu, couldn't stop the ball even though he dived!

06:07.770 --> 06:09.420
Was he not quick enough?

06:10.500 --> 06:15.180
I'm happy you move like I imagined, Japanese keeper-san.

06:15.180 --> 06:17.660
Damn him! He's making a fool out of me!

06:18.150 --> 06:21.630
This isn't good. They've got complete control of the game.

06:26.540 --> 06:27.960
Somehow...

06:27.960 --> 06:30.620
Somehow we have to break Argentina's pace.

06:30.620 --> 06:32.500
Diaz, Pascual,

06:32.500 --> 06:34.780
which one of you is planning something?

06:35.170 --> 06:37.500
Japan doesn't want to give up any more goals.

06:37.500 --> 06:41.540
Will the Golden Duo, Misaki-Ohzora, be able to turn around the tables?

06:42.200 --> 06:43.610
Roberto.

06:43.610 --> 06:46.270
Tsubasa, who you are calling a prodigy,

06:46.270 --> 06:48.500
and Diaz, who I mentioned myself,

06:48.500 --> 06:50.710
are now playing each other on the pitch!

06:55.230 --> 06:56.360
That's naive!

06:56.360 --> 06:58.820
He thinks he can get past me?

06:58.820 --> 06:59.600
There!

06:59.950 --> 07:00.850
Wow, incredible!

07:00.850 --> 07:02.420
Diaz stole the ball from Misaki!

07:02.860 --> 07:05.460
Diaz is coming! Stop him!

07:06.390 --> 07:08.630
Is this all the Japanese team is capable of doing?

07:08.630 --> 07:09.460
In that case...

07:10.290 --> 07:13.260
Diaz shoots from the center circle!

07:13.260 --> 07:15.100
This is a Drive Shot!

07:15.100 --> 07:16.470
And it's in!

07:16.470 --> 07:19.280
It's a hat-trick. How is this possible?

07:19.280 --> 07:22.040
Diaz is now the top scorer in this blowout!

07:22.040 --> 07:24.100
Shit!

07:24.100 --> 07:27.530
He did a Drive Shot?!

07:27.530 --> 07:29.950
He didn't shoot it against Italy...

07:29.950 --> 07:34.140
He wants to show his strength before the final, or what?!

07:34.140 --> 07:37.600
Diaz shot the Drive Shot after taking the ball from Ohzora!

07:37.600 --> 07:39.940
The genius, Juan Diaz, is frightening!

07:41.940 --> 07:44.940
Japanese soccer is pretty weak.

07:44.940 --> 07:49.970
I'm going to see what kind of scoring records I'll set with you guys.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.480
He's smiling?

07:55.620 --> 07:57.200
Tsubasa!

07:57.620 --> 08:02.100
Three goals. Isn't that a perfect handicap?

08:04.750 --> 08:06.140
T-Tsubasa?

08:06.140 --> 08:07.700
What did he say?!

08:07.700 --> 08:10.620
The three goals I scored are a handicap?!

08:17.140 --> 08:19.690
Japan counterattacks now.

08:20.140 --> 08:21.280
Come!

08:21.280 --> 08:24.400
I'll show you who's the better player!

08:25.010 --> 08:26.050
Diaz,

08:26.050 --> 08:27.190
Pascual.

08:27.190 --> 08:29.730
If you have one weak point,

08:29.730 --> 08:33.990
it's that you haven't experienced any defeat until now.

08:37.370 --> 08:39.460
No matter how strong the opponent is,

08:39.460 --> 08:41.880
Tsubasa will find a way to overcome.

08:41.880 --> 08:45.750
Just like I did when I put an end to your winning streak.

08:46.410 --> 08:48.380
It's true that happened.

08:48.900 --> 08:50.200
Barbas.

08:50.200 --> 08:52.900
The game against Japan won't be easy.

08:58.920 --> 08:59.900
I challenge you!

09:01.000 --> 09:02.220
Ohzora avoids Diaz

09:02.220 --> 09:03.980
and passes the ball over to Misaki.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.340
Here!

09:08.220 --> 09:09.450
He's gonna shoot!

09:09.450 --> 09:10.860
Guard the goal!

09:11.880 --> 09:12.700
Yes!

09:11.880 --> 09:12.700
Yes!

09:13.100 --> 09:15.300
Ohzora shoots the Drive Shot!

09:17.480 --> 09:20.580
But he misses the goal by far!

09:20.580 --> 09:22.060
All right!

09:23.690 --> 09:26.700
Tsubasa's showing his trust in me with this pass!

09:26.700 --> 09:28.060
I have to score at all costs!

09:33.580 --> 09:34.900
It's in!

09:34.900 --> 09:36.380
3 - 1!

09:35.510 --> 09:37.340
Nice pass, Tsubasa!

09:37.340 --> 09:39.340
Nice shot, Hyuga-kun!

09:39.340 --> 09:43.380
Ohzora Tsubasa saw the positioning against his shot, so he decided to pass at the last minute,

09:43.380 --> 09:46.140
and then Hyuga Kojiro made 
good on his chance at a goal!

09:46.140 --> 09:47.660
He did it!

09:47.660 --> 09:49.660
That's just amazing, Japan!

09:49.660 --> 09:51.140
Yes, a goal!

09:51.140 --> 09:55.040
It's their Super Golden Combo Counterattack!

09:56.180 --> 09:59.490
Damn it. There was another player like that on the Japanese team?

09:59.490 --> 10:02.480
He only evaded my challenge.

10:03.220 --> 10:06.730
I promise I'll make him pay for this humiliating goal!

10:10.180 --> 10:13.500
Out of the blue, it's Diaz, storming into Japan's territory!

10:14.240 --> 10:15.680
Hyuga!

10:15.680 --> 10:17.700
He got past him!

10:17.700 --> 10:19.520
Over here, Diaz!

10:19.520 --> 10:20.260
Diaz!

10:20.260 --> 10:23.100
I won't let Japan make fools out of us!

10:23.100 --> 10:25.020
Diaz runs into Ohzora!

10:25.020 --> 10:26.720
This is the anticipated duel!

10:29.080 --> 10:31.030
He got past Ohzora, too!

10:31.030 --> 10:32.160
However,

10:32.160 --> 10:36.300
Misaki, and also Ohzora, catch up to Diaz!

10:38.890 --> 10:40.220
What? They're both shooting?

10:40.220 --> 10:41.340
No... Ohzora is...

10:42.020 --> 10:43.530
passing the ball to Misaki!

10:43.530 --> 10:45.200
Diaz lost the duel...

10:45.200 --> 10:45.900
No way...

10:47.100 --> 10:49.620
Diaz, you're too hot-tempered.

10:50.140 --> 10:54.170
Together, Ohzora and Misaki were able to surpass the duo from Argentina.

10:54.660 --> 10:55.740
Matsuyama-kun!

10:56.960 --> 10:59.660
The Japanese team puts pressure on Diaz.

10:59.660 --> 11:01.660
Good. This is great. Continue to attack!

11:02.110 --> 11:04.160
The end of the first half is close.

11:04.160 --> 11:06.380
Japan really wants to score one more goal.

11:06.380 --> 11:09.380
They don't let any chance to attack pass.

11:09.380 --> 11:11.440
Tsubasa and Misaki can't move like they want.

11:11.440 --> 11:13.220
Things are up to us.

11:13.220 --> 11:13.960
Yeah!

11:15.130 --> 11:15.900
Tsubasa!

11:21.140 --> 11:23.620
Tsubasa, pass us the ball!

11:25.150 --> 11:26.740
Jito, the Tachibana brothers...

11:26.740 --> 11:29.420
All right, I'm leaving the rest up to you!

11:29.420 --> 11:30.700
Let's do it, Jito!

11:30.700 --> 11:31.660
Yeah!

11:40.140 --> 11:41.220
What?!

11:42.220 --> 11:44.700
Take this on! It's the Twin Shot!

11:46.620 --> 11:48.720
It's in! It's the second goal!

11:47.660 --> 11:49.140
They did it!

11:49.140 --> 11:50.140
What?!

11:56.910 --> 11:58.310
Tachibana!

11:59.100 --> 12:04.100
The Tachibana brothers violently hit the crossbar and are now being taken away on stretchers.

12:04.100 --> 12:08.100
What will Japan do if both have to come off?

12:12.160 --> 12:14.160
Only one more goal...

12:21.540 --> 12:23.100
I've told you countless times,

12:23.100 --> 12:25.830
you can't underestimate the Japanese team.

12:25.830 --> 12:27.930
Don't leave everything up to Diaz.

12:27.930 --> 12:29.980
Play soccer all together!

12:29.980 --> 12:31.170
Y-Yes!

12:31.170 --> 12:33.600
Coach, there's no reason to worry.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.420
I haven't been vigilant enough.

12:35.420 --> 12:37.750
They won't score in the second half.

12:37.750 --> 12:38.850
Diaz...

12:38.850 --> 12:39.930
You...

12:39.930 --> 12:42.380
We're Argentina's national team,

12:42.380 --> 12:45.220
and against the Japanese team, I alone <i>will</i> be enough!

12:45.220 --> 12:47.420
Let's enjoy this second half!

12:47.420 --> 12:49.950
Yahoo! Leave this up to us, Diaz!

12:49.950 --> 12:51.420
We'll show 'em!

12:54.320 --> 12:57.330
I'll settle the score with him this half.

13:03.490 --> 13:07.100
There's no way I'm gonna let them tie up the game!

13:07.100 --> 13:09.940
I'm the international player Diaz!

13:09.940 --> 13:12.010
Diaz, don't get so emotional.

13:12.010 --> 13:13.570
We'll get caught up in their pace!

13:13.940 --> 13:15.450
Diaz, make a pass!

13:15.450 --> 13:16.920
Pass me the ball!

13:23.340 --> 13:27.810
He took the ball from me again!

13:27.810 --> 13:29.380
This is unforgivable!

13:29.380 --> 13:30.530
Diaz.

13:30.530 --> 13:31.730
Why are you so impatient?

13:31.730 --> 13:34.380
Use Pascual more.

13:37.100 --> 13:40.100
Diaz!

13:42.500 --> 13:44.370
Diaz goes back to defend.

13:44.370 --> 13:46.000
But Matsuyama's keeping up.

13:46.000 --> 13:48.810
Diaz, I'm not a prodigy like you,

13:48.810 --> 13:51.500
but I'm part of the Japanese national team!

13:51.500 --> 13:52.580
Shut up!

13:53.460 --> 13:55.980
I won't hand the ball over to you!

13:56.870 --> 13:58.820
Tsubasa, I have faith in you!

13:58.820 --> 13:59.740
Damn it!

14:04.100 --> 14:05.660
Hyuga-kun, get ready!

14:08.700 --> 14:09.540
All right!

14:09.540 --> 14:11.350
Will Hyuga be on time?

14:11.350 --> 14:13.100
He's completely shaken off his markers.

14:14.050 --> 14:16.570
He does a Tiger Diving Header!

14:18.540 --> 14:19.760
Hyuga-kun!

14:19.760 --> 14:21.100
He did it!

14:21.100 --> 14:23.030
It's in!

14:23.030 --> 14:26.580
Japan counterattacked, and Hyuga did it!

14:26.580 --> 14:28.580
All right, now we're tied!

14:28.580 --> 14:30.660
Tsubasa-kun...

14:34.020 --> 14:35.110
Tsubasa!

14:35.110 --> 14:36.570
The game's just starting!

14:36.570 --> 14:37.260
Yeah!

14:37.260 --> 14:39.470
Nice play, Matsuyama!

14:39.470 --> 14:41.280
Well done, Matsuyama!

14:41.280 --> 14:42.580
Yeah, thank you.

14:42.580 --> 14:44.100
Hyuga...

14:44.100 --> 14:46.740
He scored with a header?!

14:47.350 --> 14:50.380
But, to win this game, vivacity alone isn't enough.

14:51.860 --> 14:52.900
Misugi!

14:54.420 --> 14:55.100
Yes!

14:57.140 --> 14:59.360
There's only five minutes remaining.

14:59.360 --> 15:01.560
We have to take the lead here.

15:02.140 --> 15:05.030
But they'll mark you even more.

15:06.110 --> 15:07.260
Misugi-kun...

15:07.260 --> 15:11.780
Oh! Japan makes Nitta go out, replacing him with Misugi.

15:11.780 --> 15:15.000
Misugi Jun: the glass ace, the prince of the pitch.

15:15.000 --> 15:17.580
This is his first appearance against Argentina.

15:19.760 --> 15:21.090
I'm leaving this up to you.

15:21.090 --> 15:22.020
All right!

15:22.020 --> 15:23.500
Misugi-kun!

15:26.020 --> 15:27.940
There's no time to lose! Let's go!

15:27.940 --> 15:28.820
All right!

15:28.820 --> 15:30.920
Let's turn this around, guys!

15:30.920 --> 15:31.820
YEAH!

15:32.190 --> 15:36.200
They picked a good time to put in Misugi-san.

15:36.200 --> 15:36.610
Yeah.

15:36.610 --> 15:38.820
Misugi has now entered, and the game resumes.

15:40.090 --> 15:42.010
I'm counting on you, Misugi!

15:43.180 --> 15:46.260
Misugi's having the Japanese team pass the ball around!

15:46.260 --> 15:48.500
Diaz is marking Ohzora. He doesn't let go!

15:48.500 --> 15:51.220
I won't let you get the ball!

15:51.220 --> 15:53.700
Diaz, stop preoccupying yourself with Tsubasa!

15:53.700 --> 15:55.700
Tsubasa's mine, you hear!

15:59.470 --> 16:01.140
Diaz! Diaz!

16:04.140 --> 16:06.490
Diaz, what are you doing?!

16:07.060 --> 16:08.540
Pascual frees himself.

16:08.540 --> 16:11.020
And now he's up against Misugi!

16:11.020 --> 16:12.060
You won't get it!

16:20.020 --> 16:22.340
Misugi took back the ball!

16:22.340 --> 16:23.340
Damn it!

16:23.850 --> 16:26.520
He floats like a butterfly and stings like a bee.

16:26.520 --> 16:27.980
What magnificent play!

16:27.980 --> 16:31.020
Misugi Jun is crossing the field in a stunning manner!

16:31.700 --> 16:35.100
Japan had another player like this?!

16:35.100 --> 16:36.890
Misugi...

16:36.890 --> 16:39.510
If you hadn't had the heart problems,

16:39.510 --> 16:43.440
you would have been, without a doubt, a regular on the Japanese team.

16:45.060 --> 16:46.580
He's in front of the goal!

16:46.580 --> 16:47.980
Over here, Misugi-kun!

16:48.300 --> 16:50.300
He shoots... No, he passes!

16:50.300 --> 16:52.820
Nice pass, Misugi-kun!

16:52.820 --> 16:54.500
Ohzora prepares to shoot on the volley!

16:54.500 --> 16:56.380
I won't let you!

16:58.900 --> 16:58.900
Good!

16:59.380 --> 16:59.910
What?!

16:59.910 --> 17:00.660
Misugi-kun!

17:00.660 --> 17:02.870
I have to score. For everyone on the team...

17:02.870 --> 17:05.500
and for myself! Here I go!

17:06.060 --> 17:08.140
Goal!

17:08.140 --> 17:11.100
Misugi, the glass ace who's suffering from a heart condition,

17:11.100 --> 17:13.980
just scored with an extraordinary overhead kick!

17:13.980 --> 17:15.660
They've taken the lead!

17:16.250 --> 17:18.480
All right! Let's score another one!

17:18.480 --> 17:20.670
Let's continue like this and attack more!

17:22.100 --> 17:25.270
Diaz, stop worrying about Tsubasa.

17:25.270 --> 17:27.740
We're supposed to be playing soccer.

17:27.740 --> 17:29.810
Not one-on-one duels.

17:29.810 --> 17:30.900
Pascual...

17:30.900 --> 17:35.740
Haven't we been playing all this time to win games?

17:41.480 --> 17:42.220
Diaz...

17:42.980 --> 17:46.740
You, who had no rival in Argentina, are tasting defeat for the first time.

17:46.740 --> 17:49.740
But you have to climb over this wall.

17:50.390 --> 17:53.700
Tsubasa's making you doubt yourself.

17:53.700 --> 17:55.740
You have to trust your own abilities more!

17:56.280 --> 17:58.740
You're the prodigy I found.

18:01.090 --> 18:06.620
We're losing because of how I played, but the coach still hasn't taken me off yet.

18:07.460 --> 18:11.830
He stills wants me to be the backbone of this team?

18:14.230 --> 18:16.340
Pascual, you too.

18:17.240 --> 18:20.890
You've always been patient, listening to my vagaries...

18:21.890 --> 18:23.910
My precious childhood friend...

18:24.860 --> 18:26.110
Pascual...

18:26.110 --> 18:27.330
Yeah?

18:27.330 --> 18:31.250
That number 10, Ohzora Tsubasa, is strong when it's about turning things around.

18:31.250 --> 18:35.380
They say he's a prodigy who becomes even stronger under pressure.

18:35.380 --> 18:40.420
That's true. That's why we gave him that handicap in the beginning.

18:40.420 --> 18:41.660
Eh?

18:44.180 --> 18:47.180
Okay, let's win this, Pascual.

18:47.180 --> 18:49.180
Yeah! Of course!

18:52.530 --> 18:54.980
Argentina's behind by one goal.

18:54.980 --> 18:58.170
If Japan can keep this score, they'll continue on to the final rounds.

18:58.170 --> 19:00.350
There's not much time left.

19:01.100 --> 19:02.620
I'm counting on you all!

19:03.660 --> 19:04.740
Oh!

19:04.740 --> 19:06.130
Diaz passed the ball!

19:06.130 --> 19:08.980
Diaz makes the ball move around again!

19:11.550 --> 19:12.620
Diaz passes to Pascual!

19:13.170 --> 19:14.940
It's just like it used to be.

19:14.940 --> 19:16.200
Yeah.

19:27.530 --> 19:29.090
All right, good, good.

19:29.090 --> 19:30.300
To me!

19:30.300 --> 19:31.360
You're good! Good!

19:33.900 --> 19:34.480
Here!

19:37.090 --> 19:38.740
Let's do this, Pascual.

19:39.100 --> 19:40.340
Yeah.

19:40.900 --> 19:42.940
The goal... Protect the goal!

19:44.380 --> 19:45.940
Let's finish this, Diaz!

19:47.580 --> 19:49.430
Here it comes!

19:51.890 --> 19:53.220
He blocked it!

19:54.590 --> 19:55.850
We're at it!

19:55.850 --> 19:57.760
The time's almost up now!

19:57.760 --> 19:59.580
Will this be the last chance?

19:59.580 --> 20:01.380
Defend! Defend at all cost!

20:08.710 --> 20:11.020
Not yet! It's not over yet!

20:12.660 --> 20:16.460
I have to win for the sake of everyone... for the sake of Argentina!

20:18.700 --> 20:19.980
We won't let you shoot!

20:19.980 --> 20:21.260
Let's block this!

20:21.260 --> 20:22.030
Come at it!

20:22.030 --> 20:24.260
I'll protect the Japanese goal!

20:27.420 --> 20:29.180
We have to fight our hardest until the end...

20:30.180 --> 20:31.420
We have to win!

20:34.060 --> 20:36.680
It's the end of the game!

20:42.870 --> 20:45.420
Japan's victorious!

20:45.420 --> 20:48.220
They now advance to the semifinals.

20:48.220 --> 20:51.390
Let's hope they'll go all the way to the top!

21:00.700 --> 21:02.660
Awesome, Tsubasa-kun!

21:02.660 --> 21:04.540
I'm so happy for you, Tsubasa!

21:09.680 --> 21:10.580
Diaz...

21:14.260 --> 21:17.120
I didn't know there were guys as good as them.

21:17.120 --> 21:19.540
I guess my soccer playing was still soft.

21:25.700 --> 21:27.060
Diaz...

21:32.870 --> 21:36.160
I wonder if we'll be playing them again sometime.

21:37.470 --> 21:38.200
Diaz.

21:46.290 --> 21:48.860
When that time comes, our duo will defeat them.

21:49.410 --> 21:50.530
Of course.

21:57.710 --> 21:59.800
Diaz, Pascual.

21:59.800 --> 22:01.670
Let's play each other again sometime!

22:04.100 --> 22:09.780
Preview

22:06.050 --> 22:09.900
We, the Japanese national team, reached the final.

22:10.450 --> 22:13.660
During the semifinals, we played against the host team, France.

22:13.660 --> 22:17.780
When the artist of the field, Elle-Sid Pierre, entered, the stadium went wild.

22:17.780 --> 22:21.580
Pierre's elegant soccer playing had us on the run.

22:21.580 --> 22:22.870
Come on, Pierre!

22:23.460 --> 22:25.220
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:25.220 --> 22:26.300
An Elegant Commander.

22:25.300 --> 22:34.020
An Elegant Commander

22:26.300 --> 22:27.810
Look forward to it!

22:27.810 --> 22:29.980
Let's aim for tomorrow! Goal!

22:34.460 --> 22:38.300
tsumiageru jibun no takasa wa

22:34.460 --> 22:38.300
My skill keeps on growing.

22:38.300 --> 22:42.620
dare ni mo kimerarenai

22:38.300 --> 22:42.620
Nobody can measure it.

22:42.620 --> 22:46.300
komiageru jibun no yowasa wo

22:42.620 --> 22:46.300
The weakness that grows inside me,

22:46.300 --> 22:50.620
dare ni mo miserarenai

22:46.300 --> 22:50.620
I can't let anyone see it.

22:50.620 --> 22:58.580
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

22:50.620 --> 22:58.580
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

22:58.580 --> 23:04.660
aa ima susumu yo

22:58.580 --> 23:04.660
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:10.540 --> 23:14.340
tondekuru koishi wo haratte

23:10.540 --> 23:14.340
I ward off the pebble flying towards me,

23:14.340 --> 23:18.660
bai no hayasa de kaesu

23:14.340 --> 23:18.660
And return it with twice as much speed.

23:18.660 --> 23:22.340
yandeiru kotori wo hirotte

23:18.660 --> 23:22.340
I pick up an ill little bird,

23:22.340 --> 23:26.660
ooki na sora ni kaesu

23:22.340 --> 23:26.660
and return it to the wide open sky.

23:26.660 --> 23:34.580
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

23:26.660 --> 23:34.580
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

23:34.580 --> 23:40.620
aa ima susumu yo

23:34.580 --> 23:40.620
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:46.060 --> 23:50.620
ima daseru subete no chikara de

23:46.060 --> 23:50.620
Using all the strength I have,

23:50.620 --> 23:54.140
koukai wa shitakunai

23:50.620 --> 23:54.140
without feelings of regret...

23:54.140 --> 24:01.620
ima daseru subete no chikara de saikou no kachi

23:54.140 --> 24:01.620
Using all the strength I have, to the ultimate victory.
